# =============================================================================
#  scanners-botnets.data
#  Substring patterns matched (case-insensitively) against the User-Agent
#  header of every request. Used by rule 1000001 in REQUEST-899-CUSTOM-WAF.conf.
#
#  Rules are evaluated after the "t:lowercase" transformation, therefore every
#  pattern below MUST be written in lower case.
#
#  The list is intentionally focused on security scanners, exploitation
#  frameworks and tooling commonly used by botnets so it does not break normal
#  browsers. Extend it as new scanners appear.
# =============================================================================

# --- vulnerability / web application scanners ---
nikto
sqlmap
sqlninja
jsql
xsser
nmap
nmap scripting engine
masscan
zmap
zgrab
w3af
skipfish
grabber
commix
arachni
whatweb
wpscan
joomscan
droopescan
dirbuster
dirb
gobuster
feroxbuster
wfuzz
ffuf
nuclei
jaeles
xray
openvas
nessus
acunetix
netsparker
qualys
appscan
burpcollaborator

# --- internet-wide research / scanning services ---
censysinspect
shodan
internetmeasurement
netsystemsresearch
paloalto

# --- botnet / malware characteristic markers ---
zmeu
morfeus
mirai
hakai
tsunami
kaiten
gafgyt
bashlite
qbot
brickerbot
iot_reaper
satori

